 jim's enemy and mentor the arcane order  soon finds out that nari's real soul  isn't  in her body and they perform their own  incantation to reverse dukxy's spell but  right before nari is transferred back to  her original body she tells the  guardians they have to get their hands  on the chronosphere  and they have to do the ninth  configuration ninth configuration  sounds like an 80s boy band and no one  has any idea what that means lucky for  them the accuridians have fixed jim's  trollhunter amulet but when they track  down the arcane order  it doesn't work allowing the order to  summon the titans and begin the end of  the world  the amulet failed i  failed the three titans emerge in  various parts of the world the ice titan  and greenland the earth titan in brazil  and the fire titan in china  they're all making their way to the  quote center of the universe which just  so happens to be  jim's hometown of arcadia they have 18  hours to stop them before they converge  and destroy the world for good jim  thinks that the reason his amulet didn't  work was that it didn't contain merlin's  magic so he sends stewart and krell to  retrieve excalibur which has one of  merlin's magic stones  buried in its hilt they normally would  have gone to get merlin's staff but that  was destroyed  claire is sent on a mission to find the  chronosphere which was last seen in the  hands of a troll dragon known as  zhongshi he covets the chronosphere  because it holds the power of time being  able to show the past and future  of course he wants to know how he'll die  so he can prevent it from happening  it's ironic then that he'll see how he  dies mere moments before it happens  meanwhile jim and walter take on skrell  and the ice titan when they find out  that camelot's cannons do little damage  to this walking behemoth  walter ends up sacrificing himself using  an ungodly amount of explosives  it's a pretty sad ending for a guy who  just got engaged but as we'll see with  all the deaths in this film including  toby's at the very end this may not be  the last time we see everyone  walter's death is in vain however when  the ice titan merely resurrects  it seems the only way to stop these  titans is to stop whomever is  controlling them  halfway across the world nomura tries to  take down the earth titan but is also  killed in the process  it isn't until dukxy is able to  physically grab a hold of nari that he's  able to snap her out of her spell  giving the guardians control of one of  the three titans  one of the lines dukxy uses to snap nari  out of it is  no more running that's because for the  last year or so the two have been on the  run  hiding from the arcane order it's about  time they stop running  and fight which is exactly what they do  unfortunately in this epic battle both  nari and skrell are killed destroying  both of their titans in the process  now you think that would be the end of  it doesn't the end of the world require  all three titans well blinky missed an  important sticky page in his ancient  grimoire that says if only one titan  succeeds  that will be the element from which the  world will be reborn  so if only the fire titan makes it to  the heart stone the world will be reborn  in fire and ash  doesn't sound too enticing stuart  manages to bring over excalibur there's  just one  problem jim has tried to remove  excalibur from the stone before but it  didn't work  what will make it different now that's  when he remembers nari's words  that he has to use the ninth  configuration the ninth configuration  isn't  a thing it's them so they all put their  hands on the rock while jim is able to  remove the blade this allows him to  retrieve merlin's magic stone from  excalibur which he gives to stuart to  replace in the amulet and when stewart  does replace it  nothing happens that's because jim  hasn't yet realized  it wasn't the amulet that made him a  hero it was the courage he already had  inside  it's only when jim confronts bellrock  and recognizes this that the amulet  returns to him and he can finally become  the troll hunter  once again the amulet didn't make me a  hero  i already was toby also gets a fun  little character arc in the film  at the beginning he laments that he's  always relegated to being the sidekick  and is never the hero  well toby really becomes a hero when he  risks his life to save jim  using the accuridian device to nullify  bellrock's powers  i'm powerless don't worry  you get used to it bellrock is defeated  and the fire titan crumbles but toby is  crushed under the falling rubble jim and  gang  are able to say their goodbyes and in  anger argument throws the chronosphere  which inspires jim to crack it open  revealing the time stone if jim goes  back in time he could potentially  prevent toby's death  as well as all these other events from  ever happening so jim puts the time  stone in the amulet and wakes up on the  same day of episode 1 of the  trollhunters tv show but there are a few  key differences here  instead of 6 am like the tv show it's 8  am both versions have raccoons knocking  over the trash but in rise of the titans  jim is ecstatic to see toby confirming  he's alive in this timeline later on in  school jim shows his excitement for  trying out for the romeo and juliet play  while in the original timeline he barely  even knows who shakespeare is  jim sterling to come over to dinner to  meet his mom knowing the two will  eventually hit it off so already jim is  trying to shape this new timeline  he's even the one to recommend that toby  checks out the canal that canal being  the place where he first found the  trollhunter amulet which kicked off the  tales of the arcadia saga this suggests  that in this timeline toby becomes the  chosen one but it's jim's monologue he  uses to audition for romeo and juliet  that sums up the series and what it  means to be a hero  never forget that fear is but the  precursor to valor that to strive and  triumph  in the face of fear is what it means to  be a hero  now this ending can end here but i think  they've left this open for more movies  and tv shows  remember that nari said time is like a  flower meaning it branches in different  directions  imagine a troll hunter multiverse  similar to what marvel is doing the  movie also began with blinky reciting  this story  essentially proving the existence of  multiple universes  you could have different troll hunters  from different universes coming together  to fight a big  enemy i think that could be a great idea  to keep this series going but what do  you think was troll hunter's rise of the  titans a fitting end to the series and  do you want to see it continue i want to  hear your comments below  thanks for watching everyone be sure to  like and subscribe and for more bad  takes you can always follow me on  twitter and instagram at think story yt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much
 

